#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:41
msgid ""
"f-strings cannot support expressions that require parsing to resolve "
"unbalanced nested braces and brackets"
msgstr "f-string 不支持需要解析来处理不平衡嵌套花括号和方括号的表达式"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Always use balanced braces and brackets in expressions "
"inside f-strings"
msgstr "**解决方法：** 在 f-string 内的表达式中始终使用平衡的花括号和方括号。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:66
msgid "f-strings don't support !a conversions"
msgstr "f-string 不支持 ``!a`` 转换"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:68
msgid "**Cause:** MicropPython does not implement ascii()"
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 未实现 ``ascii()``。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:70
msgid "**Workaround:** None"
msgstr "**解决方法：** 无。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:88
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "类"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:93
msgid "Special method __del__ not implemented for user-defined classes"
msgstr "用户自定义类未实现特殊方法 ``__del__``"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:122
msgid "Method Resolution Order (MRO) is not compliant with CPython"
msgstr "方法解析顺序（MRO）与 CPython 不兼容"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:124
msgid "**Cause:** Depth first non-exhaustive method resolution order"
msgstr "**原因：** 采用深度优先的非穷举方法解析顺序。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Avoid complex class hierarchies with multiple inheritance "
"and complex method overrides. Keep in mind that many languages don't support"
" multiple inheritance at all."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 避免使用包含多重继承和复杂方法覆盖的复杂类层次结构。请注意，许多编程语言根本不支持多重继承。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:155
msgid "Private Class Members name mangling is not implemented"
msgstr "未实现私有类成员的名称混淆"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:157
msgid ""
"**Cause:** The MicroPython compiler does not implement name mangling for "
"private class members."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 编译器未实现私有类成员的名称混淆。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Avoid using or having a collision with global names, by "
"adding a unique prefix to the private class member name manually."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 手动为私有类成员名称添加唯一前缀，以避免与全局名称冲突。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:199
msgid ""
"When inheriting native types, calling a method in ``__init__(self, ...)`` "
"before ``super().__init__()`` raises an ``AttributeError`` (or segfaults if "
"``MICROPY_BUILTIN_METHOD_CHECK_SELF_ARG`` is not enabled)."
msgstr ""
"在继承原生类型时，若在 ``__init__(self, ...)`` 中于 ``super().__init__()`` 之前调用方法，将引发 "
"``AttributeError``（若未启用 ``MICROPY_BUILTIN_METHOD_CHECK_SELF_ARG`` 则可能导致段错误）。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:201
msgid ""
"**Cause:** MicroPython does not have separate ``__new__`` and ``__init__`` "
"methods in native types."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 的原生类型中没有独立的 ``__new__`` 和 ``__init__`` 方法。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:203
msgid "**Workaround:** Call ``super().__init__()`` first."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 先调用 ``super().__init__()``。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:247
msgid "When inheriting from multiple classes super() only calls one class"
msgstr "从多个类继承时，``super()`` 只调用一个类"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:249
msgid "**Cause:** See :ref:`cpydiff_core_class_mro`"
msgstr "**原因：** 请参见 :ref:`cpydiff_core_class_mro`。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:251
msgid "**Workaround:** See :ref:`cpydiff_core_class_mro`"
msgstr "**解决方法：** 请参见 :ref:`cpydiff_core_class_mro`。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:296
msgid ""
"Calling super() getter property in subclass will return a property object, "
"not the value"
msgstr "在子类中调用 ``super()`` 的 getter 属性将返回属性对象，而非其值"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:326
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:331
msgid "Error messages for methods may display unexpected argument counts"
msgstr "方法的错误信息可能显示意外的参数个数"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:333
msgid "**Cause:** MicroPython counts \"self\" as an argument."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 将 \"self\" 计入参数个数。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:335
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Interpret error messages with the information above in mind."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 解读错误信息时请考虑上述情况。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:356
msgid "Function objects do not have the ``__module__`` attribute"
msgstr "函数对象没有 ``__module__`` 属性"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:358
msgid ""
"**Cause:** MicroPython is optimized for reduced code size and RAM usage."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 针对减少代码体积和 RAM 占用进行了优化。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:360
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Use ``sys.modules[function.__globals__['__name__']]`` for "
"non-builtin modules."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 对于非内置模块，使用 ``sys.modules[function.__globals__['__name__']]``。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:385
msgid "User-defined attributes for functions are not supported"
msgstr "不支持函数的用户自定义属性"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:387
msgid "**Cause:** MicroPython is highly optimized for memory usage."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 针对内存使用进行了高度优化。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:389
msgid "**Workaround:** Use external dictionary, e.g. ``FUNC_X[f] = 0``."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 使用外部字典，例如 ``FUNC_X[f] = 0``。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:413
msgid "Generator"
msgstr "生成器"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:418
msgid ""
"Context manager __exit__() not called in a generator which does not run to "
"completion"
msgstr "未运行至结束的生成器中，上下文管理器的 ``__exit__()`` 不会被调用"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:460
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "运行时"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:465
msgid "Local variables aren't included in locals() result"
msgstr "局部变量不包含在 ``locals()`` 的结果中"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:467
msgid ""
"**Cause:** MicroPython doesn't maintain symbolic local environment, it is "
"optimized to an array of slots. Thus, local variables can't be accessed by a"
" name."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 不维护符号化的局部环境，而是优化为槽数组，因此局部变量无法通过名称访问。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:491
msgid "Code running in eval() function doesn't have access to local variables"
msgstr "在 ``eval()`` 函数中运行的代码无法访问局部变量"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:493
msgid ""
"**Cause:** MicroPython doesn't maintain symbolic local environment, it is "
"optimized to an array of slots. Thus, local variables can't be accessed by a"
" name. Effectively, ``eval(expr)`` in MicroPython is equivalent to "
"``eval(expr, globals(), globals())``."
msgstr ""
"**原因：** MicroPython 不维护符号化的局部环境，而是优化为槽数组，因此局部变量无法通过名称访问。实际上，MicroPython 中的 "
"``eval(expr)`` 等价于 ``eval(expr, globals(), globals())``。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:519
msgid "import"
msgstr "import"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:524
msgid "__all__ is unsupported in __init__.py in MicroPython."
msgstr "MicroPython 的 ``__init__.py`` 中不支持 ``__all__``。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:526
msgid "**Cause:** Not implemented."
msgstr "**原因：** 未实现。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:528
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Manually import the sub-modules directly in __init__.py "
"using ``from . import foo, bar``."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 在 ``__init__.py`` 中使用 ``from . import foo, bar`` 手动直接导入子模块。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:550
msgid ""
"__path__ attribute of a package has a different type (single string instead "
"of list of strings) in MicroPython"
msgstr "MicroPython 中包的 ``__path__`` 属性类型不同（单个字符串而非字符串列表）"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:552
msgid ""
"**Cause:** MicroPython doesn't support namespace packages split across "
"filesystem. Beyond that, MicroPython's import system is highly optimized for"
" minimal memory usage."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 不支持跨文件系统拆分的命名空间包，且其导入系统针对最小内存占用进行了高度优化。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:554
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Details of import handling is inherently implementation "
"dependent. Don't rely on such details in portable applications."
msgstr "**解决方法：** 导入处理的细节本质上依赖于具体实现，请勿在可移植应用中依赖这些细节。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:574
msgid ""
"MicroPython doesn't support namespace packages split across filesystem."
msgstr "MicroPython 不支持跨文件系统拆分的命名空间包。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:576
msgid ""
"**Cause:** MicroPython's import system is highly optimized for simplicity, "
"minimal memory usage, and minimal filesystem search overhead."
msgstr "**原因：** MicroPython 的导入系统针对简洁性、最小内存占用和最小文件系统搜索开销进行了高度优化。"

#: ../../genrst/core_language.rst:578
msgid ""
"**Workaround:** Don't install modules belonging to the same namespace "
"package in different directories. For MicroPython, it's recommended to have "
"at most 3-component module search paths: for your current application, per-"
"user (writable), system-wide (non-writable)."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 不要将属于同一命名空间包的模块安装到不同目录。对于 MicroPython，建议模块搜索路径最多包含 3 "
"个部分：当前应用目录、用户级（可写）和系统级（只读）。"
